  "notes": "USAGE:\nSense 2 (surpassing a number) is very common in news reports and statistics. The pattern is ～を{突破|とっぱ}する, where the object is the number or limit being exceeded.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {壁|かべ}を{突破|とっぱ}する: to break through a wall/barrier\n- {百万|ひゃくまん}を{突破|とっぱ}: to surpass one million\n- {記録|きろく}を{突破|とっぱ}する: to break a record\n- {現状|げんじょう}{突破|とっぱ}: breaking through the status quo",
